# Reference specification bundle: large, and third-party copyrighted
# material (TIA / ETSI / 3GPP). Must never be committed.
project-VectorCore-MCX/

# Build output
bin/
web/node_modules/

# Runtime artefacts
*.db
*.log

# NOTE: web/dist is deliberately NOT ignored. web/embed.go declares
# //go:embed all:dist, so the directory must exist for `go build` and
# `go test ./...` to compile at all. Untracking it breaks a fresh clone
# until `make ui` has been run.
